* Task 6b fixture: CALLDBPROC with dynamic proc names
* Demonstrates FR-10, FR-14 requirement: variable proc names and & placeholders
* yield EdgeCallsDynamic (consistent with feature-06 CALLNAT handling)

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #PROCVAR (A30)
  1 #EMP-ID (N8)
  1 #EMP-NAME (A30)
END-DEFINE

* Variable proc name — dynamic edge
CALLDBPROC #PROCVAR #EMP-ID #EMP-NAME

* &-placeholder literal — dynamic edge (runtime substitution)
CALLDBPROC 'GET_&LANG' #EMP-ID #EMP-NAME

END
